"""
HERO — SWORD COMBAT ANIMATION SET (v3) — Blender build script
==============================================================
Open  hero-rigged-2.blend  (the ORIGINAL file, not the v2 output) in Blender 4.2 or newer, go to the Scripting tab,
open this file in the Text Editor and press  Run Script.  Takes a few minutes (weight cleanup + keyframing).
Result is saved as  hero-sword-v3.blend  next to the original (the original is not modified).

Rig additions (non-deforming helper bones; all exported to glTF as normal joints):
  Sword_Grip     child of Hand.R. Rotation Y = the sword rolling inside the fist (edge alignment),
                 scale = sword visibility (0 = in the pocket dimension, 1 = drawn).
  Sword_Aura     blue glow shell around the blade (scale 0 = off, 1 = full glow during swings).
  Sword_Ghost1-4 blue after-glow copies of the blade trailing the swing (motion trail).
  Sword_Portal   pocket-dimension rift used by the summon / dismiss clips.
  Fist_Ctrl      location X = right-hand fist amount, Z = left-hand fist amount (drives the finger shape keys).

Actions (30 fps, everything in place; markers "hit" on impact frames):
  Unarmed  : Hero_Idle, Hero_Walk, Hero_Run (loops), Hero_Jump (+ _Start / _Air loop / _Land)
  Combat   : Hero_Sword_Idle, Hero_Combat_Walk, Hero_Battle_Run (loops)
  Attacks  : Hero_Attack1..5, Hero_Attack_Combo
  Transfers: Hero_Sword_Summon, Hero_Sword_Dismiss  (+ _Upper variants: arms/chest/FX only, to layer over walk/run)
"""
